&lt;li&gt;Glassdoor Best Places to Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forbes Best Places to Work for Women&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Weekly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive compensation package:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; $60,000 / year depending on qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus potential:&lt;/strong&gt; weekly Bonus incentives based on caseload management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mon-Fri work hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AMAZING culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong employee values and recognition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small team at a local office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care offers a comprehensive benefits plan that includes the following: Paid holidays, vacation and sick leave, vision, dental and medical health plans, employer paid life insurance, 401k with company match, direct deposit and employee assistance program&lt;/li&gt;
